[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Three spot lights aimed straight down with the same 35 degree cone and
; different spot_attenuation, to compare how their edges fade: 0.25 (left,
; nearly hard), 1 (middle, Godot's default) and 4 (right, soft). A sphere
; under each shows the fade across a curved surface.

